; One variable: the SubViewport's use_hdr_2d. Each pair draws the same lit canvas twice, with it on at
; the left or top and off beside it. A linear canvas adds each light to the linear albedo with no
; clamp, keeps the light colour, the cookie and the shadow colour as authored, and seeds the
; CanvasModulate in linear. Torch pair: a PointLight2D with a shadow. Sun pair: a DirectionalLight2D
; with a shadow. Hot pair: a torch of energy 8 under a container modulate of 0.5, which shows that a
; value above 1 survives into the consumer. Every other lit golden runs with use_hdr_2d off, so none
; shows the linear arithmetic.

